{"id": "189650992783", "postBody": "<div class=\"hs-embed-wrapper hs-fullwidth-embed\" data-service=\"youtube-nocookie\" data-responsive=\"true\" style=\"position: relative; overflow: hidden; width: 100%; height: auto; padding: 0; min-width: 256px; display: block; margin: auto; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"><div class=\"hs-embed-content-wrapper\"><div style=\"position: relative; overflow: hidden; max-width: 100%; padding-bottom: 56.25%; margin: 0px;\" data-mce-style=\"position: relative; overflow: hidden; max-width: 100%; padding-bottom: 56.25%; margin: 0px;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><iframe style=\"position: absolute; top: 0px; left: 0px; width: 100%; height: 100%; border: none;\" title=\"YouTube video player\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" xml=\"lang\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/Gt70U5UPouc?si=PioGTdgikH8i13d-\" width=\"560\" height=\"315\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen data-mce-src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/Gt70U5UPouc?si=PioGTdgikH8i13d-\" data-mce-style=\"position: absolute; top: 0px; left: 0px; width: 100%; height: 100%; border: none;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></iframe></div></div></div>\n<!--more-->\n<h3>About this webinar</h3>\n<p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; letter-spacing: 0px;\">The era of agentic AI has arrived. Intelligent agents are now handling tasks, making decisions, and driving productivity—transforming how businesses operate. As traditional SaaS tools built for manual input reach their limits, agentic applications are taking over with AI-driven systems that reason, act, and adapt autonomously.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">You’ll learn:</span><br><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span>How agentic services differ from traditional transactional applications</span></li>\n<li><span>Why legacy architectures fall short in supporting AI-native experiences</span></li>\n<li><span>Core design patterns for building scalable, intelligent agents</span></li>\n<li><span>How platforms like Akka power event-driven, autonomous AI systems</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h4><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">Related items</span></h4>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://content.akka.io/hubfs/collateral/presentations/akka-infoq-agentic-ai-design-patterns.pdf\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Webinar slides</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://45500578.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/45500578/collateral/webinars/transcripts/agentic-ai-design-patterns-q-&amp;-a.pdf\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Q&amp;A transcript</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/blog/agentic-ai-use-cases\" rel=\"noopener\">21 Agentic AI use cases shaping the future of AI</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/blog/key-capabilities-for-agentic-ai\" rel=\"noopener\">5 key capabilities for agentic AI: Unlocking the future of intelligent automation with Akka</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/blog/new-akka-deployment-options-elasticity-on-any-infrastructure\" rel=\"noopener\">New Akka deployment options: elasticity on any infrastructure</a></li>\n</ul>", "templatePath": ""}